*Heading
** Stable-increment probe at the real element sizes: one 1.25 x 1.25 x 0.25 mm solid
** element with one zero-thickness cohesive element on top of it, which is what the
** coupon model is made of. The initial stable increment printed in the .sta isolates
** which of the two element types sets the step, and how the cohesive section's
** constitutive thickness enters it.
